        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonathan Lynn, Ettore Scola, Peter Cellier, Antony Jay\n- Works: Yes Minister, Yes, Prime Minister\n- Topics: British sitcoms, political satire, film and television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Ettore Scola was born on 10 May 1931 and died on 19 January 2016.\n- Jonathan Lynn was born on 3 April 1943 and is an English stage and film director, producer, writer, and actor.\n- Yes Minister is a British political satire sitcom written by Antony Jay and Jonathan Lynn.\n- Yes Minister was first transmitted on BBC Two from 1980 to 1984 and was split over three seven-episode series.\n- In the 1980s, Peter Cellier was known for playing Sir Frank Gordon in Yes Minister and Yes, Prime Minister.",
